<title>UK: ScotPower H1 pretax, post-exceps profits up.</title>
<headline>ScotPower H1 pretax, post-exceps profits up.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-12-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months ending September 30</p>
<p>			   (million stg unless stated)</p>
<p> Shr (pence)(adjusted)  14.01		  vs 11.14</p>
<p> Dividend (pence)	 6.17		   vs 5.17</p>
<p> Reorganisation costs   21.2		   vs nil</p>
<p> Pretax		     167.1		  vs 127.7</p>
<p> Pretax pre-exceps	188		    vs n/a</p>
<p> Turnover		   1,247.9		vs 776.9</p>
<p>NOTE - Analysts had forecast pre-tax profits in a range between 175 and 189.4 million stg.</p>
<p>Full company name - Scottish Power Plc</p>
</text>
